# Keeps the Docker build context small and fast — without this, every
# `docker build` (local or Render's) uploads the whole repo, including
# things the zoning-engine image never needs: node_modules (apps/web,
# services/project), the 253MB locally-vendored ODA install (gitignored,
# irrelevant to the image — the Dockerfile fetches its own copy at build
# time), git history, and every service's own runtime output.
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
services/cad-interop/oda
services/cad-interop/test
services/zoning-engine/storage
services/zoning-engine/__pycache__
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
apps/web/dist
docs/reference
